<p class="not-first:mt-[1.5em] leading-[1.65em] text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-200">Do not retry transactions that returned <code class="nextra-code" dir="ltr">Unprocessable</code> — the parameters are invalid and retrying will always fail. Only retry on network errors or <code class="nextra-code" dir="ltr">500</code> responses.</p></main><div class="x:mt-12 x:mb-8 x:text-xs x:text-gray-600 x:text-end x:dark:text-gray-400">Last updated on<!-- --> <time dateTime="2026-04-02T08:03:17.000Z">April 2, 2026</time></div><div class="x:mb-8 x:flex x:items-center x:border-t x:pt-8 nextra-border x:print:hidden"><a title="API Clients" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus x:text-gray-600 x:dark:text-gray-400 x:hover:text-gray-800 x:dark:hover:text-gray-200 x:contrast-more:text-gray-700 x:contrast-more:dark:text-gray-100 x:flex x:max-w-[50%] x:items-center x:gap-1 x:py-4 x:text-base x:font-medium x:transition-colors x:[word-break:break-word] x:md:text-lg x:pe-4" href="/api-clients"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" height="20" class="x:inline x:shrink-0 x:ltr:rotate-180"><path d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="grid grid-cols-[max-content_auto] gap-2"><span class="inline-flex w-full h-[1.15em] mt-[0.1em]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M1.01562 0.903198H6.875V6.76257H1.01562V0.903198Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"></path><path d="M13.1162 1.29382L16.2412 6.95804H9.99124L13.1162 1.29382Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"></path><path d="M0.625 13.2079C0.625 14.0885 0.974818 14.933 1.5975 15.5557C2.22018 16.1784 3.06471 16.5282 3.94531 16.5282C4.82591 16.5282 5.67045 16.1784 6.29313 15.5557C6.91581 14.933 7.26562 14.0885 7.26562 13.2079C7.26562 12.3273 6.91581 11.4827 6.29313 10.8601C5.67045 10.2374 4.82591 9.88757 3.94531 9.88757C3.06471 9.88757 2.22018 10.2374 1.5975 10.8601C0.974818 11.4827 0.625 12.3273 0.625